  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "拿彩色螺絲來交換喔。\n來交換卡娜莉玩偶喔。<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62FF5F69827287BA7D724F864EA463DB55943002000A4F864EA463DB53615A1C838973A950765594300200100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳有彩色螺絲，\n我是可以用卡娜莉玩偶跟<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳交換啦。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C00100003110000FF01014F6059B367095F69827287BA7D72FF0C000A6211662F53EF4EE5752853615A1C838973A950768DDF00100003110000FF01014F6059B34EA463DB556630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "交換",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EA463DB0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "紅色卡娜莉玩偶嗎？\n據說它可以讓經驗值變多喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7D05827253615A1C838973A9507655CEFF1F000A64DA8AAA5B8353EF4EE58B937D939A57503C8B8A591A559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "金色卡娜莉玩偶嗎？\n據說它可以讓錢變多喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91D1827253615A1C838973A9507655CEFF1F000A64DA8AAA5B8353EF4EE58B9393228B8A591A559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "粉紅色卡娜莉玩偶嗎？\n據說它可以讓超級碎片變多喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7C897D05827253615A1C838973A9507655CEFF1F000A64DA8AAA5B8353EF4EE58B938D857D1A788E72478B8A591A559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "綠色卡娜莉玩偶嗎？\n據說它可以讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n更容易撐住寶可夢的招式喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7DA0827253615A1C838973A9507655CEFF1F000A64DA8AAA5B8353EF4EE58B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B300100001BE00000A66F45BB9661364904F4F5BF653EF5922768462DB5F0F559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "藍色卡娜莉玩偶嗎？\n據說它可以讓<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳更容易捉到寶可夢喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "85CD827253615A1C838973A9507655CEFF1F000A64DA8AAA5B8353EF4EE58B9300100003110000FF01014F6059B366F45BB96613634952305BF653EF5922559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳到底是來幹嘛的啊？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B352305E95662F4F865E79561B7684554AFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦！<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳拿到所有種類的\n卡娜莉玩偶了呢！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n那麼我來告訴<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳一個有用的資訊！\n如果把剩下的彩色螺絲全部拿來，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我就用超大卡娜莉玩偶跟<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳交換喔！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看來剩下的彩色螺絲\n還有<U+0010><U+0002>ȁ<U+0004>個。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n只要把剩下的彩色螺絲全部拿來，\n我就用超大卡娜莉玩偶跟<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳交換喔！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B4F8652694E0B76845F69827287BA7D72000A908467090010000202010004500B300200100001BE01000A53EA8981628A52694E0B76845F69827287BA7D72516890E862FF4F86FF0C000A62115C3175288D85592753615A1C838973A950768DDF00100003110000FF01014F6059B34EA463DB5594FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳把所有的彩色螺絲都拿來了呢！\n那麼超大卡娜莉玩偶就送給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我會把它送到<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的房間的喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3628A6240670976845F69827287BA7D7290FD62FF4F864E865462FF01000A90A39EBC8D85592753615A1C838973A950765C3190017D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B34E86FF0100100001BE00000A62116703628A5B839001523000100003110000FF01014F6059B37684623F95937684559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超大卡娜莉玩偶已經送到\n旅館Z的客房了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D85592753615A1C838973A950765DF27D9390015230000A65C59928005A76845BA2623F4E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳已經拿到所有的卡娜莉玩偶了，\n在這裡應該沒有事情要做了吧？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B35DF27D9362FF523062406709768453615A1C838973A950764E86FF0C000A5728901988E161C98A726C9267094E8B60C58981505A4E865427FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "收集到彩色螺絲之後\n要再過來喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "653696C652305F69827287BA7D724E4B5F8C000A8981518D904E4F86559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為數眾多的卡娜莉商品。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA6578773E591A768453615A1C8389554654C130020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寶可夢麻麻鰻魚王們的玩偶。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF653EF59229EBB9EBB9C3B9B5A738B5011768473A9507630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "寶可夢對戰和遊戲都很棒呢。\n就算是小孩，只要贏過大人就會獲得讚賞。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF653EF59225C0D6230548C904A623290FD5F8868D254623002000A5C317B97662F5C0F5B69FF0C53EA89818D0F904E59274EBA5C31670373725F978B9A8CDE30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "估價可是很重要的喔。\n可別用口頭約定就完事了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F3050F953EF662F5F8891CD8981768455943002000A53EF5225752853E3982D7D045B9A5C315B8C4E8B4E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "說到讓螺絲變彩色的作業，\n其實意外地很需要技巧喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA52308B9387BA7D728B8A5F69827276844F5C696DFF0C000A51765BE6610F591657305F889700898162805DE7559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把鷹架變成遊戲場也是為了\n給密阿雷的大家帶來歡樂啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "628A9DF967B68B8A6210904A623258344E5F662F70BA4E86000A7D665BC6963F96F7768459275BB65E364F866B616A02554AFF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果是<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳這位卡娜莉狂熱問答王！\n應該也能勝任全像投影卡娜莉吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C662F00100003110000FF01014F6059B390194F4D53615A1C838972C271B1554F7B54738BFF01000A61C98A724E5F80FD52DD4EFB516850CF62955F7153615A1C83895427FF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當初全像投影卡娜莉是為了\n應付奇怪的粉絲才誕生的……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但我演著演著就樂在其中了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7576521D516850CF62955F7153615A1C8389662F70BA4E86000A61C94ED85947602A76847C897D72624D8A95751F76842026202600100001BE00000A4F4662116F1484576F1484575C316A02572851764E2D4E86FF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "彩色螺絲是我們的玩心啦！\n如果有快樂的回憶就會愛上城市。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F69827287BA7D72662F62115011768473A95FC35566FF01000A5982679C67095FEB6A02768456DE61B65C316703611B4E0A57CE5E02300200100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看來就要有個大工程要開始囉！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B4F865C3189816709500B59275DE57A0B8981958B59CB56C9FF0100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真想在全世界建造鷹架遊戲場……不對，\n是真想讓全世界知道卡娜莉的魅力啊～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F60F3572851684E16754C5EFA90209DF967B6904A62325834202620264E0D5C0DFF0C000A662F771F60F38B9351684E16754C77E5905353615A1C838976849B45529B554AFF5E00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有粉絲因為爺爺扮的全像卡娜莉而開心，\n這讓我的心情有點複雜啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67097C897D7256E070BA723A723A626E7684516850CF53615A1C8389800C958B5FC3FF0C000A90198B93621176845FC360C567099EDE890796DC554A3002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沐淨她就是那種\n什麼事都會攬到身上的類型啊～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C906DE859795C31662F90A37A2E000A4EC09EBC4E8B90FD6703652C52308EAB4E0A7684985E578B554AFF5E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我說<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳……偷看直播主的螢幕\n可是違反禮儀的喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118AAA00100003110000FF01014F6059B3202620265077770B76F464AD4E3B768487A25E55000A53EF662F905553CD79AE5100768455943002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果把稜鏡塔丟著不管，\n密阿雷的大家會沒辦法歡笑的吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C628A7A1C93E158544E1F84574E0D7BA1FF0C000A5BC6963F96F7768459275BB667036C928FA66CD56B617B11768454273002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想透過來電伍讓密阿雷變得有趣啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F3900F904E4F8696FB4F0D8B935BC6963F96F78B8A5F9767098DA3554A3002001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    }
  ],
